description "Rebel SpecForce Marine

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (2)
- Clone Rifle (1)
-- 3 Concussion Blobs
- Packered Mortar Launcher
-- 8 High Powered Explosive Mortars (Frags)
- EE-4 Carbine Rifle (2)

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armour
- Stamina (3)
- 1 Reinforcement
- Assemble (1)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS3]

SpecForce Marines, although primarily trained for combat onboard ships and zero-g combat, were also used in joint operation with the Alliance Military. They were trained to use blasters and highly explosive weaponry."